{"seq":4,"slug":"advanced-applications","title":"高级与应用","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/real-analysis-measure/advanced-applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"lp-spaces-functional-basics","title":"Lp 空间与泛函分析基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/real-analysis-measure/advanced-applications/lp-spaces-functional-basics","wordCount":1523,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"fourier-analysis-basics","title":"傅里叶分析基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/real-analysis-measure/advanced-applications/fourier-analysis-basics","wordCount":1447,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"applications-and-frontiers","title":"实分析的应用与前沿","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/real-analysis-measure/advanced-applications/applications-and-frontiers","wordCount":1765,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"高级与应用\">高级与应用</h1><p>勒贝格积分一旦到手，分析的对象就从「单个函数」升格为「整个函数空间」。把所有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 次可积函数放在一起，配上由积分定义的范数，得到的不再是一堆离散的例子，而是一个有距离、有几何、还恰好完备的空间。完备性这件在实数上花大力气争取来的性质，此刻在无穷维函数空间里再次成为一切的关键——它是泛函分析能够展开的前提，也是这一章把视角从「微积分严格化」推向「现代分析」的转折。</p>\n<p>本章三篇文档由抽象走向应用。第一篇讲 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>L</mi><mi>p</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L^p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 空间与泛函分析基础，证明 Hölder 与 Minkowski 不等式、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>L</mi><mi>p</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L^p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的完备性（Riesz-Fischer），并引入 Banach 空间、Hilbert 空间与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 内积结构，说明为什么 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是所有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>L</mi><mi>p</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L^p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 中最特殊的那一个。第二篇讲傅里叶分析基础，把函数按频率分解，给出傅里叶级数与傅里叶变换、Parseval 等式与各类收敛结论，并解释这套理论为何天然栖身于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。第三篇讲实分析的应用与前沿，从概率论的测度论基础，到偏微分方程的弱解与 Sobolev 空间，再到 2026 年仍极活跃的最优传输与 Wasserstein 距离在机器学习中的应用。</p>\n<p>这一章是全 hub 的收口，处处回指前文：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>L</mi><mi>p</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L^p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的完备性直接建立在<a href=\"../integration/lebesgue-integral-convergence\">勒贝格积分与收敛定理</a>之上，傅里叶的逐点收敛问题又呼应<a href=\"../continuity-differentiation/sequences-of-functions-uniform-convergence\">函数列与一致收敛</a>里埋下的伏笔。读到这里，你应当能回望整条路径：从实数的一个窟窿出发，最终抵达支撑当代数据科学的数学骨架。</p>\n"}